{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231100","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423110001:0":{"text":"광산은 이제 안전해. 그럼 이제 가서 일 할 거지?","source_cn":"矿洞里现在安全了，可以下矿干活了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABB4B7D4AE895702","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423110002:0":{"text":"그... 그게...","source_cn":"这、这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43E75C2553965734","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423110003:0":{"text":"헬라, 솔직히 말할게!","source_cn":"海拉，实话跟你说了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EADD7457991B73E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423110004:0":{"text":"사실 우리 다 아이언비어드 쪽에 붙으려고 마음 먹었어... 그냥 상황을 지켜보고 있던 것뿐이야.","source_cn":"其实俺们几个早就想去铁须那边了……只不过想先观察观察情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26FBECD830355C70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423110005:0":{"text":"여긴 점점 사람이 줄어드는데, 아이언비어드 쪽은 계속 늘어나잖아. 우리도 앞날을 생각해야 하지 않겠어?","source_cn":"眼看这边的人越来越少，不成气候，铁须那边的人越来越多，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42A5B6805F53E830","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423110006:0":{"text":"그러니까 솔직하게 말해서, 일 안 하겠다는 거지?","source_cn":"直接点说，你们不想干了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4268496918BEB8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423110007:0":{"text":"이렇게까지 솔직하게 말할 생각은 아니었지만... 맞아.","source_cn":"俺不想说这么直接……可话说得难听点，就是这个意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54A014D9C0E27309","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1423110007":{"text":"이렇게까지 솔직하게 말할 생각은 아니었지만... 맞아.","source_cn":"俺不想说这么直接……可话说得难听点，就是这个意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54A014D9C0E27309","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423110008:0":{"text":"그건 찬성이야!","source_cn":"俺们赞成啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A1726751B569D8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423110009:0":{"text":"하지만 우리가 찬성한다고 뭐가 바뀌긴 해?","source_cn":"可俺们赞成有啥用呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37974DEC05D28117","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423110010:0":{"text":"마을의 실력자들은 다들 아이언비어드에게 붙었는데. 우리야 몸으로 때우는 것밖에 못 하잖아.","source_cn":"村里的技术好手都在铁须那边，俺们只能干点体力活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EB3E7FA8B526388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423110011:0":{"text":"모아 강철 연구가 끝났다면 당연히 남아서 도왔겠지!","source_cn":"要是这魔钢现在就能研究出来，那大伙自然都不会走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA205B57E08EAD23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423110016:0":{"text":"아무래도 가장 큰 문제는 아이언비어드 쪽인가 본데...","source_cn":"看来最大的问题还是在铁须那边……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC120F0FCB419BCF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423110017:0":{"text":"지금도 봐. 여긴 썰렁하기만 하고, 일은 고작 몇 명이 전부 떠맡은 처지잖아. 아이언비어드 쪽은 선발대 환송 연회다 뭐다 시끌벅적 하다고!","source_cn":"就瞧现在，咱这边冷冷清清的，几个人干所有的活，铁须那边...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3EB8566E5C14616","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1423110018:0":{"text":"여기서 일하느니, 우리도 거기 껴서 술이나 얻어먹고 같이 놀고 싶지!","source_cn":"比起待在这，俺们肯定更想去宴会吃点喝点，凑凑热闹啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x065B06BF96FB5E04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1423110019:0":{"text":"아이언비어드가 환송 연회를 열었다고?","source_cn":"铁须在办欢送宴？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3